      "text": "2a Consent · on the form\nBUILT · R\n\nScreen      [ ] a picture per step; only\n                the words read on the Mac\nMicrophone  [ ] narrate; only the text\n                leaves the Mac\n\nmacOS asks, by app name \"Shadow\":\nScreen Recording  Mac app windows\n                  (Chrome tabs: no prompt)\nMicrophone        narration\nAccessibility     Mac apps",
      "originalText": "2a Consent · on the form\nBUILT · R\n\nScreen      [ ] a picture per step; only\n                the words read on the Mac\nMicrophone  [ ] narrate; only the text\n                leaves the Mac\n\nmacOS asks, by app name \"Shadow\":\nScreen Recording  Mac app windows\n                  (Chrome tabs: no prompt)\nMicrophone        narration\nAccessibility     Mac apps",
