      "text": "→ spoken over an event: explains that event   (\"newest from Reporting Bot\", not this one email)\n→ spoken with no events nearby: an instruction  (becomes an llm step: read 3 numbers from the email)\n→ about timing or a rule: fills the description   (Frequency: every Monday; target: first empty row)\nAudio is never replayed. Replay runs the tree; an llm step does the \"reading\" again each run.",
      "originalText": "→ spoken over an event: explains that event   (\"newest from Reporting Bot\", not this one email)\n→ spoken with no events nearby: an instruction  (becomes an llm step: read 3 numbers from the email)\n→ about timing or a rule: fills the description   (Frequency: every Monday; target: first empty row)\nAudio is never replayed. Replay runs the tree; an llm step does the \"reading\" again each run.",
