      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "3b Understand = the DESIGN AGENT · BUILT · R\nNemotron 3 Super (smart) in a loop with tools (packages/agent)\n\nreads   form, recording, masked screen words, narration\nbuilds  edit ops + wrap_in_loop · wrap_in_branch · add_llm_step\nchecks  validate (check.ts + what a schedule run needs)\nasks    ask_user = the drill, on the draft tree (step 4)\nguard   controls only from the recording; new steps only read\nends    finish(summary) → the workflow\n\nCan't finish? The compiled first draft is kept, answers too.\nTried with a scripted model; the real model is still to try.",
      "originalText": "3b Understand = the DESIGN AGENT · BUILT · R\nNemotron 3 Super (smart) in a loop with tools (packages/agent)\n\nreads   form, recording, masked screen words, narration\nbuilds  edit ops + wrap_in_loop · wrap_in_branch · add_llm_step\nchecks  validate (check.ts + what a schedule run needs)\nasks    ask_user = the drill, on the draft tree (step 4)\nguard   controls only from the recording; new steps only read\nends    finish(summary) → the workflow\n\nCan't finish? The compiled first draft is kept, answers too.\nTried with a scripted model; the real model is still to try.",
