      "updated": 1,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Record writes v1, a verified repair writes the next version (by: debug), your edits and rollbacks write by: user. The player only reads it.\nSchema + player: BUILT for every node below (core/skill.ts, vars.ts, check.ts; player/run.ts). The design agent writes all of them.",
      "originalText": "Record writes v1, a verified repair writes the next version (by: debug), your edits and rollbacks write by: user. The player only reads it.\nSchema + player: BUILT for every node below (core/skill.ts, vars.ts, check.ts; player/run.ts). The design agent writes all of them.",
      "fontSize": 16,
      "fontFamily": 3,
