      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "llm steps transform data only: no tools, never click or send.\nApproval and ask both wait in the inbox; the run is saved and\ngoes on when you answer (even after a daemon restart).",
      "originalText": "llm steps transform data only: no tools, never click or send.\nApproval and ask both wait in the inbox; the run is saved and\ngoes on when you answer (even after a daemon restart).",
