      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Fixed on the record side (13 Oct):\n· the form fills goal, changes,\n  constants and never, so repair's\n  never-rules apply\n· v1 gets a \"Recorded\" history note\n· approval forced on outward steps",
      "originalText": "Fixed on the record side (13 Oct):\n· the form fills goal, changes,\n  constants and never, so repair's\n  never-rules apply\n· v1 gets a \"Recorded\" history note\n· approval forced on outward steps",
