      "updated": 1791900222240,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "A run executes exactly the tree you saw. Action steps never call a model; only llm steps do, and only a failure wakes the repair agent.\nBuilt for web steps (10–11 Oct). Mac-app (ax) steps replay; since 13 Oct their repair has a ladder rung and may see a masked picture.",
      "originalText": "A run executes exactly the tree you saw. Action steps never call a model; only llm steps do, and only a failure wakes the repair agent.\nBuilt for web steps (10–11 Oct). Mac-app (ax) steps replay; since 13 Oct their repair has a ladder rung and may see a masked picture.",
      "fontSize": 16,
      "fontFamily": 3,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "autoResize": true
    },
