      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "REPAIR AGENT · BUILT for web · A\nNemotron 3 Super (smart) on packages/agent\nstarts from the failure report: goal, Never,\nthe step, error, match score, page signals,\npage outline (untrusted), last 12 log events\n\nlook   failure_report page_outline find\n       inspect workflow wait (recall)\nprobe  click_safe press scroll go_back navigate\nedit   retarget · edit (insert, replace,\n       remove, move, set)\ntry    try_steps on the live page\nend    resolve · commit · escalate   (note)\nper episode 12 turns, $0.10, 20 live actions;\nper run 2 episodes, $0.25",
      "originalText": "REPAIR AGENT · BUILT for web · A\nNemotron 3 Super (smart) on packages/agent\nstarts from the failure report: goal, Never,\nthe step, error, match score, page signals,\npage outline (untrusted), last 12 log events\n\nlook   failure_report page_outline find\n       inspect workflow wait (recall)\nprobe  click_safe press scroll go_back navigate\nedit   retarget · edit (insert, replace,\n       remove, move, set)\ntry    try_steps on the live page\nend    resolve · commit · escalate   (note)\nper episode 12 turns, $0.10, 20 live actions;\nper run 2 episodes, $0.25",
