      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1791900222240,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Found in the code, for Akshat:\n1 FIXED 13 Oct (verify.ts): a waiting approval\n  is not an approval; an unapproved try no\n  longer commits\n2 try_steps can start past the failed step, so a\n  commit may never prove that step works\n3 per-run limits reset after every wait\n4 on_item_fail \"skip\" never skips under recovery\nBuilt 13 Oct: describe_screen, ax ladder rung.\nNot built: recording the fix",
      "originalText": "Found in the code, for Akshat:\n1 FIXED 13 Oct (verify.ts): a waiting approval\n  is not an approval; an unapproved try no\n  longer commits\n2 try_steps can start past the failed step, so a\n  commit may never prove that step works\n3 per-run limits reset after every wait\n4 on_item_fail \"skip\" never skips under recovery\nBuilt 13 Oct: describe_screen, ax ladder rung.\nNot built: recording the fix",
      "fontSize": 13,
      "fontFamily": 3,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "middle",
      "containerId": "p_bugs",
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "autoResize": true
    },
