      "updated": 1,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Grey, left: what the old architecture-map planned. Right: where that idea lives now. Nothing calls a model while you record any more,\nand only two things are agents (a model in a loop with tools): the DESIGN agent after Stop, and the REPAIR agent after a failure.",
      "originalText": "Grey, left: what the old architecture-map planned. Right: where that idea lives now. Nothing calls a model while you record any more,\nand only two things are agents (a model in a loop with tools): the DESIGN agent after Stop, and the REPAIR agent after a failure.",
      "fontSize": 16,
      "fontFamily": 3,
