      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Akshat's \"agentic loop for the repair in record step 6\" = the DESIGN AGENT (rows 6b + 6c).\nBuilt 13 Oct: compile.ts still makes the first draft (one Super call); the design agent then reads the\nform, the trace, the narration and the masked screen words, edits the tree, validates and asks you,\nin a loop. The REPAIR AGENT is its replay twin: same runtime, edit ops and guard idea, other tools.",
      "originalText": "Akshat's \"agentic loop for the repair in record step 6\" = the DESIGN AGENT (rows 6b + 6c).\nBuilt 13 Oct: compile.ts still makes the first draft (one Super call); the design agent then reads the\nform, the trace, the narration and the masked screen words, edits the tree, validates and asks you,\nin a loop. The REPAIR AGENT is its replay twin: same runtime, edit ops and guard idea, other tools.",
