      "text": "              REPAIR agent            DESIGN agent\nside          replay (Akshat)         record (Rushil)\nstarts when   a step fails and the    you press Stop\n              ladder could not fix it\nreads         failure report, the     form, trace, narration,\n              live page, site notes   screen words, memory\nchanges       steps of a live         builds the whole\n              workflow, guarded       draft tree\nmust not      add outward steps,      invent actions you\n              touch your decisions    never showed (ask!)\nasks you      escalate → inbox        ask_user = the drill\nends with     resolve·commit·escalate finish(summary)\nstatus        BUILT for web           BUILT (scripted model)",
      "originalText": "              REPAIR agent            DESIGN agent\nside          replay (Akshat)         record (Rushil)\nstarts when   a step fails and the    you press Stop\n              ladder could not fix it\nreads         failure report, the     form, trace, narration,\n              live page, site notes   screen words, memory\nchanges       steps of a live         builds the whole\n              workflow, guarded       draft tree\nmust not      add outward steps,      invent actions you\n              touch your decisions    never showed (ask!)\nasks you      escalate → inbox        ask_user = the drill\nends with     resolve·commit·escalate finish(summary)\nstatus        BUILT for web           BUILT (scripted model)",
